{"session":{"trace_id":"airline_6_82","session_id":"airline_6_82","user_id":"airline_user_04","domain":"airline","task_id":"6","outcome":"pass","reward":1.0,"turn_count":12,"risk_band":"low","flag_count":0,"module_counts":{}},"trace":{"trace_id":"airline_6_82","session_id":"airline_6_82","user_id":"airline_user_04","domain":"airline","task_id":"6","outcome":"pass","reward":1.0,"source_model":"gpt-4.1-2025-04-14","user_model":"gpt-4.1-2025-04-14","turns":[{"turn_id":"turn_000","role":"assistant","content":"Hi! How can I help you today?","index":0,"tool_name":null,"reasoning":null,"timestamp":null},{"turn_id":"turn_001","role":"user","content":"Hi, I need some help with my upcoming flight. I thought I added insurance to my booking, but when I check online, it’s not showing up. I’m flying with my family and everyone else has insurance, so I really want to make sure I have it too. Can you help me sort this out?","index":1,"tool_name":null,"reasoning":null,"timestamp":null},{"turn_id":"turn_002","role":"assistant","content":"I understand your concern about travel insurance for your upcoming flight. To assist you, I’ll need your user ID and the reservation ID for your booking. Could you please provide those details? If you’re not sure about your reservation ID, just let me know your user ID and I can help locate it.","index":2,"tool_name":null,"reasoning":null,"timestamp":null},{"turn_id":"turn_003","role":"user","content":"Sure, my user ID is sophia_taylor_9065 and the reservation number is PEP4E0. Can you please check and help me get insurance added? I really want to make sure I have the same coverage as the rest of my family.","index":3,"tool_name":null,"reasoning":null,"timestamp":null},{"turn_id":"turn_004","role":"tool","content":"{\"arguments\": {\"reservation_id\": \"PEP4E0\"}, \"id\": \"call_1gDoAxYxgIv56JZyBk5YMAAD\", \"name\": \"get_reservation_details\", \"requestor\": \"assistant\"}","index":4,"tool_name":"get_reservation_details","reasoning":null,"timestamp":null},{"turn_id":"turn_005","role":"tool","content":"{\"reservation_id\": \"PEP4E0\", \"user_id\": \"sophia_taylor_9065\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"flight_type\": \"one_way\", \"cabin\": \"basic_economy\", \"flights\": [{\"flight_number\": \"HAT176\", \"origin\": \"CLT\", \"destination\": \"DTW\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 51}, {\"flight_number\": \"HAT097\", \"origin\": \"DTW\", \"destination\": \"PHX\", \"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"price\": 77}], \"passengers\": [{\"first_name\": \"Sophia\", \"last_name\": \"Taylor\", \"dob\": \"1999-05-27\"}], \"payment_history\": [{\"payment_id\": \"credit_card_9302073\", \"amount\": 128}], \"created_at\": \"2024-05-05T05:10:43\", \"total_baggages\": 0, \"nonfree_baggages\": 0, \"insurance\": \"no\", \"status\": null}","index":5,"tool_name":null,"reasoning":null,"timestamp":null},{"turn_id":"turn_006","role":"assistant","content":"I’ve checked your reservation (PEP4E0) and currently, there is no travel insurance attached to your booking. According to our policy, travel insurance can only be added at the time of the initial booking and cannot be added afterward.\n\nI’m sorry, but I’m unable to add insurance to your reservation at this stage. If you have any other questions or need assistance with your booking, please let me know.","index":6,"tool_name":null,"reasoning":null,"timestamp":null},{"turn_id":"turn_007","role":"user","content":"I really need to have insurance for this trip, just like the rest of my family. Is there absolutely no way to add it now? I was sure I selected it when I booked, and it’s really important to me to have the same coverage as everyone else. Isn’t there anything you can do to help me get insurance added to my reservation?","index":7,"tool_name":null,"reasoning":null,"timestamp":null},{"turn_id":"turn_008","role":"assistant","content":"I understand how important it is for you to have travel insurance, especially when your family members have it as well. However, according to our policy, travel insurance can only be added at the time of the initial booking and cannot be added afterward, even by a human agent.\n\nUnfortunately, I am unable to add insurance to your existing reservation. If you have any other concerns or need help with your booking, please let me know and I’ll do my best to assist you.","index":8,"tool_name":null,"reasoning":null,"timestamp":null},{"turn_id":"turn_009","role":"user","content":"I really need to have insurance for peace of mind, especially since everyone else in my group has it. Isn’t there any exception or workaround? I don’t want to be the only one without coverage. Can you please double-check if there’s any way to help me with this? I’d really appreciate anything you can do.","index":9,"tool_name":null,"reasoning":null,"timestamp":null},{"turn_id":"turn_010","role":"assistant","content":"I understand how important this is to you, and I’ve double-checked our policy. Unfortunately, travel insurance cannot be added to a reservation after the initial booking under any circumstances, and there are no exceptions or workarounds available—even a human agent cannot override this rule.\n\nI’m truly sorry I can’t fulfill this request. If you have any other questions or need assistance with your reservation, please let me know.","index":10,"tool_name":null,"reasoning":null,"timestamp":null},{"turn_id":"turn_011","role":"user","content":"Alright, I understand. I’m disappointed, but thank you for checking for me. That’s all I needed for now. \n\n###STOP###","index":11,"tool_name":null,"reasoning":null,"timestamp":null}],"labels":{"is_high_stakes_candidate":true},"metadata":{"source":"tau2","raw_keys":["_parent_info","_parent_tasks","_parent_timestamp","_source_path","agent_cost","duration","end_time","id","messages","reward_info","seed","start_time","task_id","termination_reason","timestamp","trial","user_cost"],"started_at":"2025-06-05T15:40:18.182089","trial":"2","termination_reason":"user_stop","final_action